<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="view_page_about_us" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">About Us</field>
        <field name="key">textile_manufacturing.page_about_us</field>
        <field name="type">qweb</field>
        <field name="website_id" ref="website_industry"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <t t-name="textile_manufacturing.page_about_us">
                <t t-call="website.layout">
                    <div id="wrap" class="oe_structure oe_empty">
                        <section class="s_split_intro o_cc o_cc1 o_colored_level s_custom_snippet" data-snippet="s_split_intro" data-oe-shape-data="{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;html_builder/Connections/20&quot;,&quot;colors&quot;:{&quot;c5&quot;:&quot;#FFFFFF&quot;},&quot;flip&quot;:[],&quot;showOnMobile&quot;:false,&quot;shapeAnimationSpeed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;selectedColor&quot;:false}" style="position: relative;" data-name="Custom Split Intro">
                            <div class="o_we_shape o_html_builder_Connections_20" style="background-image: url(&quot;/html_editor/shape/html_builder%2FConnections%2F20.svg?c5=%23FFFFFF&quot;);"/>
                            <div class="container-fluid">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="o_not_editable oe_img_bg o_bg_img_center o_bg_img_origin_border_box pb232 o_colored_level pt256 col-lg-5 order-lg-0" style="background-image: url(&quot;/web/image/textile_manufacturing.img_custom_armadale_image_01&quot;); order: 1;" data-format-mimetype="image/webp" data-resize-width="1600" data-mimetype="image/webp" data-quality="100"/>
                                    <div class="pt256 o_colored_level pb176 col-lg-4 offset-lg-2 o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible order-lg-0" style="order: 0; animation-name: dummy;">
                                        <h1>
                                            <span class="h2-fs">Preserving the Patterns<br/><em>of the Past</em></span>
                                            <br/>
                                        </h1>
                                        <div class="s_hr pt4 pb8" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                            <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="lead">Every fabric has a history — and ours is rooted in Scotland's textile heritage. We source, curate, and share vintage and classical floral fabrics inspired by the mills, moorlands, and pattern books that shaped Scottish design for over two centuries.</p>
                                        <div class="s_hr pt4 pb8" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                            <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                                        </div>

                                    </div>

                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </section>
                        <section class="s_faq_list o_colored_level o_cc o_cc2 pt104 pb0" data-snippet="s_faq_list" data-name="FAQ List">
                            <div class="container">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="pt16 pb16 o_colored_level col-lg-12 o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible" style="animation-name: dummy;">
                                        <div>
                                            <h2>How it Started</h2>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="pt16 pb16 col-lg-6 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible" style="animation-delay: 0.1s; animation-name: dummy;">
                                        <div>Our journey began with a single find: a bolt of faded chintz, tucked away in an old sewing box, printed with a floral pattern that hadn't been made in decades. That one piece of fabric led to a deeper search — through estate sales, archives, and forgotten mill records — to uncover more of these patterns before they disappeared for good.</div>
                                        <div>
                                            <br/>
                                        </div>
                                        <p>What started as a personal collection grew into something we wanted to share: a place where makers, collectors, and lovers of textile history could find fabric that simply isn't made anymore.</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="pt16 pb16 o_colored_level col-lg-6 o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible" style="animation-delay: 0.2s; animation-name: dummy;">
                                        <div>We track down vintage and classical fabrics with a focus on Scottish floral heritage — from hand-printed chintz to toile-inspired botanicals, heather and thistle motifs, and tartan-influenced florals. Every piece is inspected for quality and authenticity before it reaches our shelves, so you can trust what you're getting is genuine, wearable, and ready to use.</div>
                                        <div>
                                            <br/>
                                        </div>
                                        <p>We don't mass-produce. Once a bolt sells out, it's gone — which means every purchase is part of a limited, ever-changing collection.</p>
                                    </div>

                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </section>
                        <section class="s_text_bold o_colored_level o_cc o_cc2 oe_img_bg o_bg_img_center o_bg_img_origin_border_box pt120 pb120" data-snippet="s_text_bold" data-name="Text Bold" style="position: relative; background-image: url(&quot;/web/image/textile_manufacturing.img_custom_armadale_image_02&quot;);" data-format-mimetype="image/webp" data-resize-width="1954" data-mimetype="image/webp">
                            <div class="s_allow_columns container">
                                <h2 class="h1-fs" style="text-align: center;">
                                    <em>When you shop with us, you're not just buying yardage. You're helping preserve a small, beautiful piece of Scottish textile history for its next chapter.</em>
                                    <br/>
                                </h2>
                            </div>
                        </section>
                        <section class="s_showcase pt80 o_colored_level pb0" data-vcss="003" data-snippet="s_showcase_square" data-name="Showcase Square" data-oe-shape-data="{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;html_builder/Connections/20&quot;,&quot;colors&quot;:{&quot;c5&quot;:&quot;#FFFFFF&quot;},&quot;flip&quot;:[&quot;y&quot;],&quot;showOnMobile&quot;:false,&quot;shapeAnimationSpeed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;selectedColor&quot;:true}" style="position: relative;">
                            <div class="o_we_shape o_html_builder_Connections_20" style="background-image: url(&quot;/html_editor/shape/html_builder%2FConnections%2F20.svg?c5=%23FFFFFF&amp;flip=y&quot;); background-position: 50% 0%;"/>
                            <div class="container">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-lg-6 o_colored_level">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col-lg-12 o_colored_level pb40 pt48 o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible" style="animation-name: dummy;">
                                                <h2>Our Values</h2>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-lg-6 pt8 pb8 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible" data-name="Feature" style="animation-delay: 0.1s; animation-name: dummy;">

                                                <div class="d-flex flex-column">
                                                    <p>
                                                        <img src="/web/image/textile_manufacturing.img_custom_armadale_image_03" alt="1" class="img img-fluid o_we_custom_image o_attachment_pending_record_id" loading="lazy"/>
                                                    </p>
                                                    <h3>
                                                        <span class="h4-fs">Authenticity</span>
                                                    </h3>
                                                    <p>Every fabric is vetted for age, origin, and condition.</p>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-lg-6 pt8 pb8 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible" data-name="Feature" style="animation-delay: 0.2s; animation-name: dummy;">

                                                <div class="d-flex flex-column">
                                                    <p>
                                                        <img src="/web/image/textile_manufacturing.img_custom_armadale_image_04" alt="2" class="img img-fluid o_we_custom_image o_attachment_pending_record_id" loading="lazy"/>
                                                    </p>
                                                    <h3>
                                                        <span class="h4-fs">Sustainability</span>
                                                        <br/>
                                                    </h3>
                                                    <p>By giving vintage textiles new life, we help reduce demand for fast fashion and mass-produced prints.</p>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-lg-6 pt8 pb8 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible" data-name="Feature" style="animation-delay: 0.2s; animation-name: dummy;">

                                                <div class="d-flex flex-column">
                                                    <p>
                                                        <img src="/web/image/textile_manufacturing.img_custom_armadale_image_05" alt="3" class="img img-fluid o_we_custom_image o_attachment_pending_record_id" loading="lazy"/>
                                                    </p>
                                                    <h3>
                                                        <span class="h4-fs">Craftsmanship</span>
                                                        <br/>
                                                    </h3>
                                                    <p>We respect the mills, printers, and designers who created these patterns.</p>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-lg-6 pt8 pb8 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible" data-name="Feature" style="animation-delay: 0.3s; animation-name: dummy;">

                                                <div class="d-flex flex-column">
                                                    <p>
                                                        <img src="/web/image/textile_manufacturing.img_custom_armadale_image_06" alt="4" class="img img-fluid o_we_custom_image o_attachment_pending_record_id" loading="lazy"/>
                                                    </p>
                                                    <h3>
                                                        <span class="h4-fs">Authenticity</span>
                                                        <br/>
                                                    </h3>
                                                    <p>We believe history shouldn't sit behind glass:&amp;nbsp;it should be worn, sewn, and used.</p>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>

                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-6 o_snippet_mobile_invisible d-lg-block d-none o_colored_level" data-invisible="1">
                                        <img src="/web/image/textile_manufacturing.img_custom_armadale_image_07" alt="Photo model with flower shirt" class="img img-fluid ms-auto float-end o_we_custom_image o_attachment_pending_record_id" data-format-mimetype="image/webp" data-resize-width="1024" data-mimetype="image/webp" loading="lazy" data-quality="100"/>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </section>
                        <section
                            class="s_title_split pt80 o_cc pb0 o_colored_level s_custom_snippet o_cc1"
                            data-snippet="s_title_split" data-name="Custom Title Split"
                            data-oe-shape-data="{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;html_builder/Connections/19&quot;,&quot;colors&quot;:{&quot;c5&quot;:&quot;o-color-3&quot;},&quot;flip&quot;:[],&quot;showOnMobile&quot;:false,&quot;shapeAnimationSpeed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;selectedColor&quot;:true}"
                            style="position: relative;">
                            <div class="o_we_shape o_html_builder_Connections_19" style="background-image: url(&quot;/html_editor/shape/html_builder%2FConnections%2F19.svg?c5=%23FFFFFF&quot;);" />
                            <div class="s_allow_columns container-fluid">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div
                                        class="o_colored_level col-lg-6 offset-lg-3 o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible o_draggable o_animated"
                                        style="visibility: visible; animation-play-state: running;">
                                        <p style="text-align: center;">
                                            <br />
                                        </p>
                                    </div>

                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </section>
                    </div>
                </t>
            </t>
        </field>
    </record>
    <data noupdate="1">
        <record id="page_about_us" model="website.page" forcecreate="0">
            <field name="view_id" ref="view_page_about_us"/>
            <field name="url">/about-us</field>
            <field name="website_id" ref="website_industry"/>
            <field name="is_published" eval="True"/>
            <field name="website_indexed" eval="True"/>
            <field name="header_overlay" eval="True"/>
        </record>
    </data>
</odoo>
